5,0,1,talk,Asuka,,I will focus on logical consistency. I believe the best way to find the werewolf is to track contradictions in statements over time.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,May,,"This sounds so serious! I'll just go with my intuition and see who seems the most suspicious. It's more fun that way, right?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Rin,,I want to find the wolf! I'll follow whoever seems the smartest and most exciting. May-san seems fun!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Minako,,I agree with Asuka. We need to prioritize facts. I will be observing everyone's behavior to see if anyone is acting out of character.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,Logic is the only way. I'll be watching for those who try too hard to manipulate the mood. That's usually a sign of guilt.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"@May, intuition is risky. We should establish a baseline of how everyone speaks today to detect changes tomorrow.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,May,,"Oh, Asuka-san is so strict! But maybe that's why we need her. I'll just be my usual charming self.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Rin,,"A baseline? That sounds like a science project! But if it helps us win, I'm in!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Minako,,"It is a sound strategy. If someone suddenly becomes defensive or overly aggressive, it will be a red flag.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,Exactly. The werewolf will likely try to blend in or divert attention. I'll be looking for those diversions.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Asuka,,I'll be paying close attention to the voting patterns on Day 1. That often reveals the hidden alliances.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,May,,Alliances? How scandalous! I wonder who is secretly working together. This is getting exciting!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Rin,,Secret alliances! It's like a spy movie! I'm going to watch everyone very closely!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Minako,,Let's not get carried away by the excitement. We must remain calm to avoid being misled by the werewolf.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,Minako is right. Emotional reactions are tools for the werewolf. I'll remain detached.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
