31,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"I have information. May is the werewolf. I am the Seer, and my divination confirms it.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,May,,"What?! Asuka-san, that's a bold lie! You're probably the werewolf trying to frame me right at the start!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Rin,,"Eh?! May-san is the wolf? But she's so nice! Asuka-san, are you sure?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""May"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Minako,,"This is a direct confrontation. Asuka has claimed the Seer role immediately. May, how do you respond logically?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Shion,,"A Seer claiming early is a high-risk, high-reward move. Either Asuka is telling the truth, or she's a very aggressive werewolf.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"I have no reason to lie. If I were the werewolf, I wouldn't target the most sociable person immediately and draw all the heat.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,May,,"That's exactly what a clever wolf would do! She's trying to look ""brave"" to gain your trust. Please don't believe her!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Rin,,"I don't know who to believe! May-san looks so sad, but Asuka-san sounds so sure!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""May"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@May, your response is purely emotional. Asuka's claim is a factual statement of her role.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""May"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, if you are the Seer, why reveal yourself now instead of gathering more data? It seems inefficient.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"Because with only five players, we cannot afford to lose more people. We must execute the werewolf now.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,May,,"She's just rushing us so we don't have time to think! @Shion, @Minako, please look at how she's forcing the vote!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Rin,,"May-san is right, it is a bit fast! Maybe we should wait?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Minako,,"Actually, in a small group, the Seer's early reveal is the most efficient path to victory. I lean toward Asuka.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Shion,,"The logic holds. If Asuka is the Seer, May dies and we win. If Asuka is the wolf, we lose one villager but gain a lead on her.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Asuka,,The evidence is my divination. Vote for May.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,May,,"I'm innocent! Please, don't let her trick you!","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Rin,,I'll trust the adults... I think I'll go with Asuka-san. She seems really serious!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Minako,,I vote for May. The risk of keeping a confirmed werewolf is too high.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Shion,,I'll follow the logic. May's defense is too focused on emotion and not enough on counter-evidence.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
